75853971433829", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391974_675853974767162_2914553798335547424_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TPC94Yi7zKgQ7kNvwEk16b6&_nc_oc=Adp3CyNMXhCHdHJurEzJxMA76L2bDaTg8Rlqy6eUoyZoRvRoTrbnvRKNYyeNLCllZDg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMLNpbWCIfatnCkjk6WW-lxzrfpYXTEk7SVI-GnNUqcXQ&oe=6AE4B329"}, {"file_name": "Screen4.png", "id": "636978668937683", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391883_636978672271016_9153037299005764918_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LCn_n-0_7GIQ7kNvwFrEtIK&_nc_oc=AdoHs_RwGpKUPbca5MAW1kWfgC72nXzbzqs7pSWjO8nCsS_iZOqGIu6x5X-PnDsoylU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMnR2eK4xlm0DlqtZz5dXAGtq30Upe0PYc-dRW2SVLrxw&oe=6AE4A348"}, {"file_name": "Screen5.png", "id": "1066890382159013", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391883_1066890385492346_7344725216413670436_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Tp3bZqtVJJ8Q7kNvwHrXnVM&_nc_oc=AdoLU5gEIUiFJoA7UPhjI2Xn4lAHrlz9p4MDjNnkYNUZo9IXwvZvCw4vrpLQmzeNNHY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPK6E9mAb9m9WTVUyk3JaM0WdAHM9ulNSigLvNUDiOLWw&oe=6AE48C2C"}, {"file_name": "Screen1.png", "id": "1287180939031732", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393325_1287180942365065_6646112765155846291_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wyiy_CuQPYAQ7kNvwEHwCeq&_nc_oc=Adr5faUFtfqgOMg0-JEdm4-XjZs0rx9G63POUus6PJP9TuNdY7hD5G18CWkR8rJhflg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPWF-oHTJst_qbPnSnRpQI5LI-BBfShSromZs2ATohqwA&oe=6AE4BE48"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "VR Travel Venice Gondola Rialto", "keywords": ["venice", "carnival", "travel", "italy", "tourist"], "long_description": "VR Travel Venice Gondola Rialto takes you on a unique gondola journey along the Grand Canal. Dart, excited to experience the magic of Venice from the water, invites Sam to join him on this unforgettable ride. Standing near the Rialto Bridge, Dart carefully selects a gondola and negotiates with the gondolier, eager to take an unusual route that most tourists don\u2019t get to experience.\n\nAs they glide under the historic Rialto Bridge and past the grand palaces lining the canal, Dart and Sam admire the breathtaking views and the lively Venetian atmosphere. The gondolier shares local insights, making the ride even more immersive. Along the way, they witness the bustling water traffic \u2013 from sleek private boats to working vessels navigating the city\u2019s lifeblood.\n\nA unique moment unfolds when they observe a garbage boat collecting waste from a docking station near the market. This rare behind-the-scenes glimpse shows how Venice operates on water, from daily life to essential services. The journey continues as the gondola reaches a scenic point where the gondolier skillfully turns the boat around, giving Dart and Sam a fresh perspective on the breathtaking scenery.\n\nHeading back toward the Rialto Bridge, the two reflect on their experience, already imagining their next adventure in Venice. Once back on land, they take a short walk up the Rialto Bridge and pause to watch the gondolas and boats moving gracefully along the Grand Canal from above.\n\n#venice #carnival #travel #italy #tourist", "short_description": "VR Travel Venice Gondola Rialto takes you on an unforgettable gondola ride along the Grand Canal. Dart invites Sam to glide under the Rialto Bridge and past magnificent palaces. As they travel along the historic palaces lining the canal, Dart negotiates with the gondolier for a special route. They witness the lively activity on the water \u2013 including a garbage boat collecting waste from the nearby market. A unique VR experience in the heart of Venice."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.vrtravelx.net/ho